### 회원가입
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "testuser",
    "password": "password123"
}


### 로그인 (Access Token + Refresh Token 발급)
# 응답에서 accessToken, refreshToken 값을 복사하여 이후 요청에 사용
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "testuser",
    "password": "password123"
  }

### Access Token 재발급
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "refreshToken": "{eyJhbGciOiJIUzM4NCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJ0ZXN0dXNlciIsInR5cGUiOiJyZWZyZXNoIiwiaWF0IjoxNzc3MTA2NjEwLCJleHAiOjE3Nzc3MTE0MTB9.RZlqmKlKdTGR3H_ZLCy5-A8HIrICtYagnp4USoC4hoxPHEHRP0Tehv6NgEmHWhaB}"
}

### 로그아웃
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {여기에_accessToken_값_붙여넣기}